Package: linux-cmnd
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), adduser
Maintainer: Music City Telecom <tommy@tomcom.us>
Description: Linux CMND deployment and Philips TV qualification tooling
 Original operator tooling for safe import and qualification of a separately
 supplied Philips CMND payload. Philips vendor applications are not included.
